{
  "id": "1TH.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "1TH",
  "reference": "1 Desalonike 5",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TH 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awoosa hidaat aba hinnooda Ng'utamiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, aba ng'asheega iita damanda ghana eaweeda jea gawas, moogassi gideaba gaydang'oorneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba agooga ghoanali beadi eaweeda Ng'utamiida gayghwaanda gidawuniida mareanghweanda eawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iyayi buuneeda, “Geebeayi hoyyoo nea geebeayi seayu,” deagheata ghwahidu nyariida badahuuka nyaawa gawuurji gidanyassiida gatmooda lajooda aba jeata baleanda, ak ea manda gichea gamulsiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea moondani jeeda misaneeda, fuga eaduupcheewi, ea ghwanung' eaweedida ghahameegwa ng'eanyi gawuurji mareanghweanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba agooga oogasean noahuuyi orjooga weeshinda, ea orjooga askweari; aseasa meebeahi eaweeda ghana misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adeelili ruweanga, ea eewuurjeewana buuneeda mwaatkwa, asi eang'weerna, nea geeteenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga rooji gwarooji eawa, nea eara fuga boogidi iissa gaboogidi eawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuku, aseasa dea siwooseewi fuga askwearda, gagasa eendeawana gheadeenda, nea geediinyi daghanuunatkaasa igeambooda masaweega ea bariinyeega, nea ngoofanjeandeanya bea gharinyeanda gagasa eanung' ghoah rarooda jea gweadu lealeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ASEETA ghayi masineasa ak abeeda ghwalas uhuudeanya, gagasa eanyasa lealeanooda aba badayda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dea ghayi meah aba badahuukaasa aba iising'eatng'eachi ghana eela abeeda geendeayi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi daba siisi amajeek nuut ak ea daba siisi adiing'u nuut gageawiit, gawuurji gidoosindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea eabeada aba huuydean ea giighata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, geemuscheegwa gideaba, asisiina mureeda fuga sin gadiyeeda aba jeedeang'wa ak gabiissa gwanda madeedeang'wa aba jeeda Ng'utamiida nea geewoowseegwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asisiina mureeda nea ghoawali gheang'da aba bariinyeega aba gadiyoojiga nyaawa. Gagasa abeaha hoyyoo nea goobeayi geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geemuscheegwa, fuga eaduupcheewi, oowoowsiina gheanyanga fuga ghaleehooda, oomajeega fuga giyoonyi, aweada fuga ng'arng'ari, ak gimilikghti sea buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula siida wassean adaghawaldaawa ng'asheanda muy dea muy, iissa ghoayaachi geeshta ng'asheanda miy galeagasean, agooga nea goobeayi geat ea biissa aba heeda buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahoosana galeagasean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amwaasha ASEETA damanyoojiga sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abadiischeena aba giliwas gil; aba gideaba nih gidabwariiyda ASEETA aba heedeang'wa aba jeeda Gristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoateali Guroorooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adoofooli ramooranga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asimsima haleanjeeda sean; ak ghoang'waanyi ng'asheanda miy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ooheeleewana geat munyinda wassean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa ghoamiidu ASEETA mideawa hoyyoo sasanuukeagwa sean, nea gaba geaw; ak gagasa gamiyeasiidi gurooruunatkeagwa ea jeesingeagwa ak geemajeek nea meerukunana badayda ng'asheega munyas aba damanda hinnooda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyeeda guurneegwa ea doabiiwaat, ak gayghoamiineegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, amusiischoaweasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oakghada fuga siduupcheewi sean aba samooda ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geamuscheegwa aba badayda Ng'utamiida, oosoamasiina fuga eaduupcheewi sean barawajeanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo oogasean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
